(2) **Check Point #1** and **Check Point #2** : Use pre-defined specifications to analysis each project,
reproducing the columns marked with "ProveNFix", in Table 2 and 3. We use the “Swoole”
project for demonstration: (The experiments cannot be done in parallel, as they write to the
same outcome file.)


